<title>THAILAND: TABLE-BEC World Q2 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BEC World Q2 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.81	 vs	     2.38</p>
<p>    Net		    560.82	 vs	   446.27</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     5.53	 vs	     4.49</p>
<p>    Net		  1,105.65	 vs	   825.79</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is BEC World Plc, a media firm.</p>
